  "segments": [
   {
    "id": "t1",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 1.36,
    "text": "When people tell you to eat healthy,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t2",
    "start": 1.36,
    "end": 3.0,
    "text": "what do they usually tell you to eat?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t3",
    "start": 3.0,
    "end": 4.4,
    "text": "Fruits and vegetables, right?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t4",
    "start": 4.4,
    "end": 6.28,
    "text": "Which totally, but what I find interesting"
   },
   {
    "id": "t5",
    "start": 6.28,
    "end": 9.52,
    "text": "is when the University of Michigan looked at 5,800 foods"
   },
   {
    "id": "t6",
    "start": 9.52,
    "end": 11.52,
    "text": "to see how many minutes they add or take away"
   },
   {
    "id": "t7",
    "start": 11.52,
    "end": 13.4,
    "text": "from your life based on various factors,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t8",
    "start": 13.4,
    "end": 15.04,
    "text": "while fruits and vegetables did well,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t9",
    "start": 15.04,
    "end": 18.12,
    "text": "there was one category that did significantly better"
   },
   {
    "id": "t10",
    "start": 18.12,
    "end": 19.16,
    "text": "than all the others."
   },
   {
    "id": "t11",
    "start": 19.16,
    "end": 23.72,
    "text": "And unfortunately, I see it demonized quite frequently."
   },
   {
    "id": "t12",
    "start": 23.72,
    "end": 25.26,
    "text": "What's another food that's deemed healthy"
   },
   {
    "id": "t13",
    "start": 25.26,
    "end": 27.12,
    "text": "but absolutely is not healthy?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t14",
    "start": 27.12,
    "end": 27.96,
    "text": "Nut butters."
   },
   {
    "id": "t15",
    "start": 27.96,
    "end": 30.08,
    "text": "Yup, nuts and or seeds."
   },
   {
    "id": "t16",
    "start": 30.08,
    "end": 31.72,
    "text": "And for all of you about to say peanuts aren't a nut,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t17",
    "start": 31.72,
    "end": 34.48,
    "text": "I would like to present to you technically all berries."
   },
   {
    "id": "t18",
    "start": 34.48,
    "end": 38.56,
    "text": "There is botanical and then culinary definitions."
   },
   {
    "id": "t19",
    "start": 38.56,
    "end": 39.92,
    "text": "Please learn the difference."
   },
   {
    "id": "t20",
    "start": 39.92,
    "end": 41.68,
    "text": "Seriously though, they have so many amazing things"
   },
   {
    "id": "t21",
    "start": 41.68,
    "end": 43.2,
    "text": "for your health, but because they're high calorie,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t22",
    "start": 43.2,
    "end": 44.2,
    "text": "people think they're unhealthy."
   },
   {
    "id": "t23",
    "start": 44.2,
    "end": 49.2,
    "text": "Fun fact, low calorie and healthy aren't the same thing."
   },
   {
    "id": "t24",
    "start": 50.27,
    "end": 51.11,
    "text": "Out of 10."
   },
   {
    "id": "t25",
    "start": 53.17,
    "end": 54.01,
    "text": "Okay, bye."
   }
  ]
 },
